{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PrivateName.html#Lean.privatePrefix?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">privatePrefix?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `n` is a private name, returns `some pfx` such that `pfx.appendCore (privateToUserName n) = n`.\nOtherwise, returns `none`.","docLink":"./Lean/PrivateName.html#Lean.privatePrefix?","kind":"def","line":84,"name":"Lean.privatePrefix?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/PrivateName.lean#L84-L92"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/PrivateName.html#Lean.privateToUserName\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">privateToUserName</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the user name corresponding to the private name `n` or `n` itself if `n` is not a\nprivate name.","docLink":"./Lean/PrivateName.html#Lean.privateToUserName","kind":"def","line":76,"name":"Lean.privateToUserName","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/PrivateName.lean#L76-L82"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span cla